==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|þurfa}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*þurbaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθʏrva/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ʏrva|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-preterite|þarf|þurfti|þurft}}

# {{lb|is|with accusative or genitive}} to [[require]], to [[need]]{{jump|need|s}}
# {{lb|is|with accusative}} to [[have to]]{{jump|have to|s}}
#: {{ux|is|Þú '''þarft''' ekki að hitta mig.|You don't '''need''' to see me.}}

